    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson BiopicMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black DressPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long HiatusBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nTV\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi’ 15 OTT Release Date And Time: When And Where To Watch Rohit Shetty’s Reality Show With Confirmed Celebrity Contestants\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi’ 15 OTT Release Date And Time: When And Where To Watch Rohit Shetty’s Reality Show With Confirmed Celebrity Contestants\n'Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ is gearing up for its much-awaited return with Rohit Shetty as host and a star-studded contestant lineup. Here’s everything to know about the OTT streaming platform, expected release update and confirmed contestants of the stunt-based reality show.\nRishika SinghMay 15, 2026, 16:15 IST\n\nKhatron Ke Khiladi is returning for Season 15 and the anticipation has been building since the first name was dropped. Rohit Shetty is back as host, the location is Cape Town, and the theme this year is Darr Ka Naya Daur. After a two-year gap, the show is promising a season that feels genuinely fresh.\n\nThe confirmed cast has already sparked plenty of conversation online, with a mix of reality show veterans, television favourites and at least one very unexpected debut. Here is everything known about the show so far.\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ OTT Release Date, Time and Where to Watch\n\nFilming is currently underway in Cape Town, South Africa. The show is expected to premiere in late June or early July 2026 on Colors TV. It will also stream on JioHotstar, though an official OTT release date and time are yet to be announced. Keep watching this space for updates.\n\n'Khatron Ke Khiladi 15' Full Confirmed Contestants List\n\nThirteen contestants have been confirmed for the season. The full lineup includes Gaurav Khanna, Rubina Dilaik, Farrhana Bhatt, Harsh Gujral, Orry, Shagun Sharma, Ruhaanika Dhawan, Avinash Mishra, Avika Gor, Jasmin Bhasin, Karan Wahi, Rithvik Dhanjani and Vishal Aditya Singh.\n\nGaurav Khanna, who won Bigg Boss 19, is reportedly the highest-paid contestant this season. Rubina Dilaik returns after a Season 12 appearance and fans expect her to go further this time. Orry makes his reality debut here, which has generated a lot of buzz on its own. Ruhaanika Dhawan, known for Yeh Hai Mohabbatein, enters as the youngest in the group at 18. Bigg Boss 19 alumni Farrhana Bhatt and Gaurav Khanna sharing the same stage again is another storyline fans are already invested in.\n\nSeason 15 has the cast, the location and the history to back up its hype. Once the official premiere date drops, this one is going straight to the top of the watchlist.\n\nTRENDING\n\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\n\n‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson Biopic\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\n\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n\nRelated Articles\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete R